THIRD-PARTY CONTENT
The argument texts in Dataset.csv (the "Argument" and "Debate" columns) were
collected from public debates on Kialo (https://www.kialo.com) and were written
by Kialo users. The authors of EthiX do not own this text, and its use is also
subject to Kialo's Terms of Service. The license above covers the authors'
contributions (the selection of arguments, the argument scheme annotations in
the "Scheme" column, and label_descriptions.txt) and is granted only to the
extent that the authors hold rights in the material.

CITATION
E. Bezou-Vrakatseli, O. Cocarascu and S. Modgil. EthiX: A Dataset for Argument
Scheme Classification in Ethical Debates. In Proceedings of the 27th European
Conference on Artificial Intelligence (ECAI 2024), pages 3628-3635, 2024.
